Games of 1996 on the XY plane (the package brantschen-games). Click a command with the
middle button; the keys are written under each game. Ctrl+Alt+C or Ctrl+Pause stops a game,
Ctrl+Alt+P pauses it (and Ctrl+Alt+P again continues it).

PBTetris.Start 1        Tetris for one player (Peter Brantschen)
PBTetris.Start 2        Tetris for two players, side by side

Minesweeper.Start 13546 10 18     the seed of the bombs, the size (3 .. 40), the bombs
Minesweeper.Anleitung             the instructions, in German

PBGames.Tron 5          Tron for two players, speed 1 .. 10 (Peter Brantschen)

RBPacMan.Spielen        PacMan (Roland Brand); a key starts it

Vier.HitMe 3            Vier gewinnt (Connect Four) for two, up to 3 won games (Michael Klein)

System.Free PBTetris Minesweeper PBGames RBPacMan Vier ~     unloads them
